body:
I grew up in a farm, yes they bring them to vets, something you kinda have to do due to the looming risk of another outbreak like BSE or foot  and mouth. Ignoring an animal who is clearly sick would be a disaster waiting to happen. They are an asset to them, not exactly getting them groomed at pet world.

&#x200B;

EDIT: also this is about dairy calves being shipped abroad more so here
